    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The Environmentally Enhanced Display (EED) is an essential tool for driving in poor conditions in all types of climates. The target user for this product is anyone who finds him or herself stuck in a situation where he or she is forced to drive in suboptimal conditions, such as night-time driving, rain storms, fog, snow, and virtually any other type of poor driving condition. The purpose of the EED is to mitigate any visibility issues drivers may have when they find themselves driving their vehicle in poor weather conditions.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
